{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-global-gluing","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:global-gluing","kind":"proposition","title":"Global gluing via twisted quantization","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-quantum-planck-constant","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-quantum-characteristic-classes"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-global-gluing"],"tags":["yekutieli","twisted-quantization","global-gluing"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.Torsion.global_gluing","text":"global-gluing.md","leanSource":"global-gluing.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:global-gluing\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a <a href=\"#def:quantum-observable-universe\" data-at=\"quantum-observable-universes/qou-definition\">quantum observable universe</a> with substrate parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>. The local deformations of the Frobenius–Hopf object <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code> induce a twisted associative deformation admitting a unique global gluing via Yekutieli's twisted quantization map <span class=\"cite\" data-keys=\"yekutieli2008 yekutieli2010\">[yekutieli2008, yekutieli2010]</span>: the direct limit algebra <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{A}_\\infty</code> (<a href=\"#def:direct-limit-algebra\" data-at=\"lifting-and-descent/direct-limit\">direct limit algebra</a>) is a well-defined global section of a sheaf of twisted deformation algebras on the underlying site <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{S}</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"6.6.8","page":"b/prop-global-gluing","qa":{"counts":{"pass":93,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":81},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.LiftingDescent.Torsion.global_gluing","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/global-gluing.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
